’Fonts, spans, inline views and images, decorations, truncation, languagespResize modes, tint, GIF / WebP, placeholders, blur, fade€Paging, snapping, zoom, scroll events, prepending, keyboard tapsdColumns, sticky sections, a chat, horizontal listsx2D context: paths, gradients, text, images, native animationShaderxWGSL shaders on the GPU: noise, gradients, animated uniformsWebView„Inline HTML with messages both ways, a web site and its navigation`A player: play, seek, volume and what it reports¼An FAQ one answer at a time, settings sections open together, controls and an accordion insideöA team with presence dots, a stacked group and its overflow, a comment thread, a profile, pictures that fail or load slowly–Kinds and sizes, icon and split buttons, progress, copying, hold to confirmşAn onboarding stepped by its buttons, a product's photos with thumbnails, banners that roll on, cards three to a view, a tickerkA␀ ␀f␀i␀l␀t␀e␀r␀ ␀w␀h␀o␀s␀e␀ ␀ S␀e␀l␀e␀c␀t␀ ␀a␀l␀l␀  ␀s␀h␀o␀w␀s␀ ␀a␀ ␀p␀a␀r␀t␀i␀a␀l␀ ␀s␀e␀l␀e␀c␀t␀i␀o␀n␀€An area, sliders of RGB, HSL, HSB or OKLCH, a field and swatches„Topics picked several at once with search, a reviewer picked aloneèA Cmd+K palette in a dialog, an inline menu, 5 000 files that filter at every keystroke, a search the server answers‚A million stocks of sixty columns, their quotes ticking every 33 ms, fixed columns, sorting, selection, resized and moved columnsšA due date on weekdays, a trip's range with presets, a meeting's day and time Two texts side by side or unified, changes navigated, reverted and kept, a patch®A workspace of tabs dragged between groups and docks, split, closed, zoomed and resized‚Code with highlighting, several carets, folding, find and replace, a language server: diagnostics, hover, definitions, completionÀPeople behind mentions, a link preview, a live stock quote, the delays tried, a card pinned open
